    "text": "Available for pre-order now\n2026 Topps Chrome® Football\nCollect the NFL’s biggest rookies, stars, and legends with stunning Chrome® designs.\nDownload Checklist\nVariations available\nPRE-ORDER\n2026 Topps Chrome® Football - Mega Box\n$79.99\n\n7 cards per pack\n\n6 packs per box\n\nLook for exclusive x-fractors\n\nAdd to cart\nPRE-ORDER\n2026 Topps Chrome® Football - Value Box\n$44.99\n\n4 cards per pack\n\n7 packs per box\n\nLook for red white & blue refractors\n\nAdd to cart\nPRE-ORDER\n2026 Topps Chrome® Football - Hanger Box\n$19.99\n\n14 cards per pack\n\n1 pack per box\n\nLook for pulsar parallels\n\nAdd to cart\nAbout the release\n\n2026 Topps Chrome® Football returns to establish Chrome® as the premier annual release for NFL collectors.\n\nThe product pairs industry-defining Chrome® Rookie Cards of the 2026 Draft Class with a deep lineup of active stars and NFL legends. Chase Rookie Cards of Fernando Mendoza, Jeremiyah Love, Carnell Tate, Jordyn Tyson, and Caleb Downs alongside stars including Josh Allen, CeeDee Lamb, Jahymr Gibbs, and Myles Garrett.\n\nSignature Short Prints bring even more personality to the product. Returning Chrome® favorites Helix, Ultra Violet, and Chrome® Radiating Rookies join football-specific chases including Game Genies, Kaiju, and Tecmo, plus new addition Glass Canvas, Madden 99 Club, and Super Bowl at Night.\n\nPremium autograph content spans rookies, veterans, and legends, delivering must-have signatures from some of the game’s biggest names, highlighted by NFL Honors Gold Shield Autographs and even more high-impact chases throughout Chrome® Football.\n\nClose\nAbout the brand\n\nTopps Chrome® is one of the most iconic trading card brands in the hobby. Renowned for its vibrant refractors, expansive rainbow chases, and premium autograph content, Topps Chrome® has helped define modern collecting across sports and entertainment.",
    "url": "https://www.topps.com/pages/topps-chrome-football"
  },
